&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Druva&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Druva is the resilience foundation for the AI enterprise, helping organizations secure and recover from connected risk across data, cyber, identity, and AI. The Resilience Cloud is a fully managed, cloud-native SaaS platform that delivers air-gapped and immutable protection across cloud, SaaS, on-premises, endpoint, and edge environments. Powered by Dru MetaGraph, Druva’s graph-powered intelligence layer, the platform connects critical business context so customers can understand risk, respond faster, recover cleanly, and govern data with greater confidence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Trusted by nearly 7,500 customers, including 75 of the Fortune 500, Druva helps safeguard the critical information and systems businesses depend on in an increasingly connected world.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.druva.com/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;druva.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and follow us on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/druva/mycompany/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/druvainc&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/DruvaInc/&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Professional Services Consultant has a responsibility to discover, design, consult, and implement Druva solutions for new and existing customers and provide best practices and guide the customer during the entire implementation cycle.&amp;nbsp; In addition, this would also include providing technical consultation on Druva’s Data Security Services and Disaster Recovery Services and conducting Cyber Simulations, Security assessments, assistance with Ransomware Recovery and Disaster Recovery Playbooks and Runbooks, configuration and integration of SIEM/SOAR tools, etc. As a member of the Professional Services team, this role will engage and drive customer success. Candidates for this pivotal position are highly dynamic and seasoned professionals with soft and technical skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Professional Services Consultant, you will interact with peers around the globe and be a mentor to your team. The ability to effectively scale your interactions from highly technical I.T. staff to key stakeholders at the Executive level is a must.&amp;nbsp; Flexibility in your current skill set and a demonstrable eagerness to learn new things are key criteria to any candidate for this position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work in a team of individual contributors who are empowered to make decisions and run their daily business tasks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discover, Design, Deploy, and Optimize Druva Solutions to meet customer requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end to end product deployments and configurations for all lines of business in Druva related to Enterprise Workloads, End User Protection, SaaS Applications and Ransomware and Disaster Recovery practices&lt;/li&gt;
